1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,211
Picture your boss

2
00:00:01,251 --> 00:00:02,488
walking you past your desk

3
00:00:02,528 --> 00:00:04,051
to a tiny room.

4
00:00:04,091 --> 00:00:05,403
No computer.

5
00:00:05,443 --> 00:00:06,328
No work.

6
00:00:06,368 --> 00:00:07,592
Just a ticking clock,

7
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:09,081
and a man in the corner

8
00:00:09,121 --> 00:00:10,432
with his feet up.

9
00:00:10,472 --> 00:00:11,271
Your new job,

10
00:00:11,311 --> 00:00:12,109
your boss says,

11
00:00:12,149 --> 00:00:13,247
is nothing.

12
00:00:13,287 --> 00:00:14,811
Sit here until six.

13
00:00:14,851 --> 00:00:15,237
At first

14
00:00:15,277 --> 00:00:17,226
it feels like a holiday.

15
00:00:17,266 --> 00:00:18,077
Then co-workers

16
00:00:18,117 --> 00:00:19,215
start staring.

17
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:20,566
The emails stop.

18
00:00:20,606 --> 00:00:21,205
Your old desk

19
00:00:21,245 --> 00:00:23,620
has someone else's photos on it.

20
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,471
Every Friday

21
00:00:24,511 --> 00:00:26,147
your boss leans in, smiling,

22
00:00:26,187 --> 00:00:27,424
to ask how you're enjoying

23
00:00:27,464 --> 00:00:28,562
your new role.

24
00:00:28,602 --> 00:00:29,839
The man in the corner

25
00:00:29,879 --> 00:00:31,103
has been here for years,

26
00:00:31,143 --> 00:00:33,092
so you put your feet up too.

27
00:00:33,132 --> 00:00:34,143
Then one Monday,

28
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:35,207
his chair is empty

29
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:36,771
and his desk is cleared.

30
00:00:36,811 --> 00:00:37,609
In Japan,

31
00:00:37,649 --> 00:00:38,460
firing someone

32
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,737
without a strong reason

33
00:00:39,777 --> 00:00:41,088
is very hard.

34
00:00:41,128 --> 00:00:42,151
So some companies

35
00:00:42,191 --> 00:00:43,415
take away the work,

36
00:00:43,455 --> 00:00:45,192
and wait for you to leave.

37
00:00:45,232 --> 00:00:46,043
Japan calls them

38
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:47,181
chase-out rooms.

39
00:00:47,221 --> 00:00:48,032
Subscribe for more

40
00:00:48,072 --> 00:00:49,523
strange facts like this.
